#. module: sports_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:sports_club.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Notes: This is because the courts are configured as shareable. As long as a "
"free spot is left, players can register and share the resource (=the courts) "
"with others."
msgstr ""
"Забележки: това е така, защото кортовете са конфигурирани като споделяеми. "
"Докато остава свободно място, играчите могат да се записват и да споделят "
"ресурса (= кортовете) с други."

#. module: sports_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:sports_club.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"On top of that, employees working behind the counter can also take phone "
"calls and book some courts. For this, they use the <strong><font "
"class=\"text-o-color-1\">Appointments &gt; Resource Schedule</font></strong> "
